00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:43.120 line:20%
Dad!

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.640 line:100%
Dad!

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:46.520 line:100%
Dad!

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:07.640 line:100%
Give my daughter back.

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:10.199 line:100%
Or…

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:12.360 line:100%
I won't leave,

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:14.480 line:100%
even if you run me over a thousand times.

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:17.080 line:100%
Don't chicken out.

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:18.560 line:100%
Floor it!

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:20.200 line:100%
Run him over!

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:21.280 line:100%
Dad!

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:23.080 line:100%
Don't hit my dad!

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:27.080 line:100%
Dad!

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:33.280 line:100%
Dad!

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:36.960 line:100%
Give my daughter…

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:38.280 line:100%
back.

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:43.320 line:100%
Turn around. Run.

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:54.360 line:100%
That's what you get
for running over my dad!

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:55.280 line:100%
How can you run over my dad!

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:56.680 line:100%
Sir!

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:59.480 line:100%
That's what you get
for running over my dad!

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:01.280 line:100%
That's what you get
for running over my dad!

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.000 line:100%
-Xiaohe.
-How dare you!

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:04.960 line:100%
-Xiaohe.
-How dare you!

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:07.280 line:100%
-Quick.
-Dad!

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:08.280 line:100%
Dad!

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:11.240 line:100%
Dad! Wake up!

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:13.320 line:100%
Don't sleep. Dad!

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:14.920 line:100%
Wake up.

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:18.520 line:100%
Wake up, Dad! Dad!

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:24.360 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:26.600 line:100%
I'm fine.

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:30.560 line:100%
Am I rocking it

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:32.920 line:100%
today?

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:41.600 line:100%
-Wake up, Dad!
-Sir!

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:43.840 line:100%
Don't sleep!

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:44.960 line:100%
Sir.

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:47.640 line:100%
-Quick. Call an ambulance.
-Okay.

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:49.200 line:100%
Sir!

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:51.120 line:100%
Hurry. Drag him out. Quick.

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:53.640 line:100%
Sir!

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:55.960 line:100%
-Wake up! Don't sleep, sir!
-How is he?

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:57.920 line:100%
His bones are fine.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.320 line:100%
Sir. Sir. Don't sleep.

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:02.240 line:100%
Mei said there was a roadblock
on the highway.

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:04.360 line:100%
Turn left at the next intersection.
There's a workshop.

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:05.400 line:100%
<i>He'll be waiting for us there.</i>

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:06.440 line:100%
Uncle Ran.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.440 line:100%
The human traffickers are there.

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:11.720 line:100%
HOMELY WORKSHOP

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.320 line:100%
AHAO AUTO MAINTENANCE

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:29.480 line:20%
POLICE

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:50.320 line:100%
Qu.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:40.040 line:100%
This is the only construction area

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:41.280 line:100%
within all three schools.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:44.440 line:100%
Only this spot
doesn't have security cameras.

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:52.760 line:100%
Let's get to work.

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:02.520 line:100%
Mister, I need your help.

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:04.080 line:100%
Have you seen these kids?

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:06.680 line:100%
Do you know anyone here who gives rides?

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:07.640 line:100%
No.

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:09.280 line:100%
Have you seen these kids?

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:10.480 line:100%
Have you seen these kids?

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:12.840 line:100%
-Have you seen these five kids?
-No.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.440 line:100%
I don't know them.

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:22.800 line:100%
I don't have a car.

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.480 line:100%
I always use a trolley to restock.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:27.880 line:100%
All right then.

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:31.280 line:100%
Wait.

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:34.360 line:100%
Someone who gives rides?
You can ask that shop.

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:36.560 line:100%
The owner loves to give people rides

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:39.000 line:100%
when he restocks.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:40.400 line:100%
He is quite scary-looking.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:44.120 line:100%
I heard that he was imprisoned once
for kidnapping.

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:46.280 line:100%
Gaoyishou?

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:54.720 line:100%
The chef is on a break.

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:56.280 line:100%
We open at five.

00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:57.600 line:100%
Where is your boss?

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.720 line:100%
We're from the Nanshan Branch.
We're asking about people giving rides.

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:09.840 line:100%
He went home to sleep.
Please return at 4:30 p.m.

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.000 line:100%
Stand right there!

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:28.760 line:100%
It hurts! Madam. Not so rough.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:30.360 line:100%
It hurts!

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:31.560 line:100%
Not so rough.

00:07:31.640 --> 00:07:33.400 line:100%
Not so rough. It hurts.

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:34.920 line:100%
PROSPEROUS BUSINESS

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:38.320 line:100%
I've never given kids a ride.

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:41.400 line:100%
You can check the dashcam in my car.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:44.200 line:100%
What's with your criminal record
of kidnapping?

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:45.960 line:100%
Who told you that?

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:48.520 line:100%
Was it the woman from--

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.640 line:100%
Just answer my question.

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:53.560 line:100%
I already served my sentence.

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:55.120 line:100%
What more do you want?

00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:57.840 line:100%
Fine.

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:00.360 line:100%
It was an argument with my wife.

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:02.040 line:100%
My wife…

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:04.720 line:100%
Well, my ex-wife

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:06.280 line:100%
returned to her parents' place
to hide from me.

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:07.800 line:100%
I was mad,

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:09.880 line:100%
so I kidnapped her and starved her.

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:11.720 line:100%
I was jailed for three years.

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:13.800 line:100%
Mr. Officer.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:16.720 line:100%
I give people rides
when I'm out restocking.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:18.320 line:100%
Is that a crime?

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:20.680 line:100%
Do you have to pin me down and arrest me?

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:22.440 line:100%
Why did you run just now?

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:25.800 line:100%
I was arrested once.

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:27.480 line:100%
Whenever I see police officers,

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:31.040 line:100%
my legs begin moving before I know it.

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:32.600 line:100%
Dad.

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:37.000 line:100%
What?

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:41.840 line:100%
Isn't she the host on the TV channel?

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:44.680 line:100%
That's him.

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:48.520 line:100%
I can recognize him,
even if he has turned into ashes.

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:56.960 line:100%
Mei.

00:08:58.320 --> 00:08:59.360 line:100%
He's still in Weiyang.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:13.600 line:100%
Why aren't they picking up?

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:21.800 line:100%
<i>Hello, Officer He?</i>

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:22.880 line:100%
Hey, Ms. Wang.

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:24.640 line:100%
Can you check if there are
needlestick injuries on Han Zi'ang?

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:41.400 line:100%
<i>Officer He. I found some.</i>

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:44.800 line:100%
<i>I found two on his right arm.</i>

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:52.960 line:100%
Mei is a regular
among the wanted criminals.

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:55.200 line:100%
He is involved
in many child trafficking cases.

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:57.760 line:100%
He is cunning and good
at disguising himself.

00:09:57.840 --> 00:10:00.440 line:100%
He has not been arrested
for more than a decade.

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:02.320 line:100%
Based on the information given
by Officer He Xiaohe,

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:03.480 line:100%
we can deduce

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:05.480 line:100%
that Mei lurks around

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:07.640 line:100%
the construction area near Fuxing Street.

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:11.120 line:100%
<i>He stalks students who skip classes</i>
<i>to hang out at the illegal internet cafe.</i>

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:14.800 line:100%
<i>Then, he injects them with anesthetics</i>
<i>before kidnapping them.</i>

00:10:24.920 --> 00:10:26.880 line:100%
The last victim, Han Zi'ang,

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:29.040 line:100%
is quite different
from the four previous victims.

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:32.440 line:100%
<i>We believe that after Han Zi'ang</i>
<i>left the internet cafe,</i>

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.040 line:100%
<i>he didn't go home.</i>

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:36.440 line:100%
<i>Instead, he went to the 18th floor</i>

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:39.120 line:100%
<i>of New York Block</i>
<i>to explore out of curiosity.</i>

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:05.240 line:100%
Help! Help! Help!

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.600 line:100%
Help! Help!

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:12.600 line:100%
After Han Zi'ang,

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:13.960 line:100%
there has been no new victim.

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.000 line:100%
PERSON OF INTEREST: MEI

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:18.200 line:100%
That means Han Zi'ang's escape
disrupted Mei's plan.

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:20.680 line:100%
He had no choice but to stop.
His priority now

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:23.280 line:100%
is to bring those four victims
out of Weiyang.

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:25.640 line:100%
Bai, Hui. Print out the wanted posters.

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:27.600 line:100%
Make sure the photo is huge.

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:29.480 line:100%
Then, let others post them everywhere.

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:31.840 line:100%
Xing. Investigate
all egresses of the city.

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.040 line:100%
Check the cameras of bus stations
and train stations

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:34.000 line:100%
to see if the culprit

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:35.680 line:100%
-has left Weiyang with the victims.
-Got it.

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:38.560 line:100%
Mangkun. Bring some men with you
and investigate the motels, hostels,

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:40.400 line:100%
or warehouses of the district.

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:42.600 line:100%
The culprit might be hiding
the victims there

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:43.640 line:100%
before buyers appear.

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:45.040 line:100%
Guys. Split up.

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:53.600 line:100%
Xiaohe,

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:55.320 line:100%
you provided a useful lead.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:57.920 line:100%
I allow you to work
with the Special Task Force.

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:59.280 line:100%
Thank you, sir.

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.520 line:100%
But given the urgency,
is casting your net wide

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:02.960 line:100%
the best way to do it?

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:05.800 line:100%
If not, we wait for Mei
to turn himself in?

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:07.000 line:100%
-But… But we are running out--
-Sorry. Captain Qu.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.400 line:100%
Xiaohe. Let's go.

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:10.640 line:100%
Why?

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:22.960 line:100%
Your deposition was excellent.

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:25.320 line:100%
And your dad is almost recovered.

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:37.360 line:100%
Xiaohe,

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:40.080 line:100%
I owe you an apology.

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:42.480 line:100%
It was my fault.

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:43.680 line:100%
I was too harsh on you.

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:46.480 line:100%
If I had put myself in your shoes,

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:49.320 line:100%
things wouldn't have ended this way.

00:12:49.840 --> 00:12:51.280 line:100%
You wouldn't have run into danger.

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:56.320 line:100%
I ask for your forgiveness.

00:12:57.760 --> 00:12:58.760 line:100%
No need to apologize.

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:03.000 line:100%
I made this mess.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:07.160 line:100%
And I will own up.

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:15.200 line:100%
You have no idea

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:18.320 line:100%
how worried your dad was
when he heard that you were in danger.

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:21.440 line:100%
He hailed a cab overnight at Mount Wu
and traveled over 400 kilometers here.

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:22.360 line:100%
I know.

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:28.600 line:100%
When he stood before the van,

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:30.720 line:100%
I already knew it.

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:32.920 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:35.080 line:100%
It's okay, Uncle Ran.

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:37.840 line:100%
Don't worry about me.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:40.040 line:100%
And no need to console me.

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:41.640 line:100%
I'm strong.

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:47.200 line:100%
Anyway, what happened
to Melon and the rest?

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:49.360 line:100%
Who?

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:51.280 line:100%
Those four guys on the esports team.

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:53.760 line:100%
After you raided the internet cafe,

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:56.160 line:100%
are they homeless now?

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:08.960 line:100%
Aren't we heading home?

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:29.560 line:100%
Eat slowly.

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:34.000 line:100%
Oh. Have you found a new base?

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:44.200 line:100%
We have been thinking a lot lately.

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.680 line:100%
There is no future in esports.

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:47.680 line:100%
It's better to go back home.

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:50.080 line:100%
We plan to work

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:52.160 line:100%
in a factory after the Chinese New Year.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:57.560 line:100%
Who says there's no future in esports?

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.000 line:100%
It's the 21st century.

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:04.880 line:100%
As long as you work with computers,

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.280 line:100%
you have a future.

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:10.440 line:100%
Besides, all of you have worked
and trained so hard.

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:12.200 line:100%
If you don't have a match
with someone else,

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:13.720 line:100%
you'll bring shame to your own hard work.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:14.920 line:100%
Exactly.

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.400 line:100%
What about the eggs I bought you guys?

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:22.400 line:100%
I know several cheap
and legit internet cafes.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:24.960 line:100%
All of you will go to the police station
to get your identity cards done

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:26.120 line:100%
to prove that you're adults.

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:27.800 line:100%
Then, you can practice there.

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:35.200 line:100%
Here.

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:47.680 line:100%
Consider this an investment from me.

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:49.320 line:100%
Once you become popular,

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:51.040 line:100%
visit the Criminal Department
and pay me back.

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:55.960 line:100%
Thank you, Officer Ran.

00:15:56.840 --> 00:15:57.880 line:100%
Dig in.

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:11.160 line:100%
Come. An extra braised egg for you.

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:14.000 line:100%
You're awesome, Uncle Ran.

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:15.680 line:100%
You're my idol for life.

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:17.120 line:100%
I'm so proud of you.

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:18.680 line:100%
Another chicken drumstick for you.

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:50.200 line:100%
What?

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:53.080 line:100%
Is my cholesterol not high enough?

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:55.520 line:100%
Forget it then.

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:58.440 line:100%
You can't put food
in my bowl and take it away.

00:17:08.319 --> 00:17:09.560 line:100%
Uncle Ran,

00:17:10.079 --> 00:17:12.880 line:100%
Melon and the guys
are ambitious, aren't they?

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:15.880 line:100%
They are good kids.

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:17.800 line:100%
They work hard and are committed.

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:20.599 line:100%
Why else did I give them
two months of my salary?

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:21.640 line:100%
Then,

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:25.720 line:100%
perhaps you should
support my dream as well.

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:27.880 line:100%
I want to study music in Beijing.

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:29.920 line:100%
I work hard and am committed.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.800 line:100%
Music is not a proper job.

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:34.120 line:100%
Your priority now is to study

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:36.240 line:100%
and get into a good university.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.080 line:100%
You were brave and smart inside the van

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.560 line:100%
with the human traffickers.

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:43.400 line:100%
You can be a criminal police officer.

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:47.480 line:100%
Do you want to join the police force
and make use of your talent?

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:50.680 line:100%
Actually,

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:53.760 line:100%
being an officer like you sounds cool.

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:56.760 line:100%
You

00:17:57.280 --> 00:18:00.280 line:100%
will never be an excellent cop like Ran.

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:01.880 line:100%
Excuse me?

00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:03.440 line:100%
I am just as smart as him,

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:04.600 line:100%
and I'm stronger than him.

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:10.920 line:100%
You can have your opinion.
I won't stop you.

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:12.120 line:100%
Just promise me

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:13.520 line:100%
that you'll study hard.

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:15.240 line:100%
After you graduate from high school,

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:16.560 line:100%
I'll send you to Beijing to study music.

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:18.480 line:100%
Why not after middle school?

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:19.880 line:100%
You have to graduate first.

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:21.840 line:100%
Be a literate rock artist.

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:22.760 line:100%
He's right.

00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:25.160 line:100%
Don't just rock and roll.

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:28.840 line:100%
-Deal.
-Deal.

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:31.200 line:100%
We don't do that anymore.

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:40.080 line:100%
Deal.

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:41.800 line:100%
I will study now then.

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:48.440 line:100%
She is skipping her meal.

00:18:56.240 --> 00:18:57.600 line:100%
Sir.

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:00.640 line:100%
Xiaohe wrote this song.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:03.920 line:100%
Listen to it when you're free.
I think she's good.

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:05.520 line:100%
-Really?
-Yes.

00:19:10.320 --> 00:19:11.440 line:100%
RESTRICTED AREA

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:17.720 line:100%
Let's have a drink.

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:20.680 line:100%
Sir.

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:23.560 line:100%
Your body hasn't recovered.
The doctor said you shouldn't drink.

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:26.720 line:100%
For this occasion, we must.

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:40.800 line:100%
Without you,

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:44.560 line:100%
my family would be all gone.

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:49.400 line:100%
I would be all alone for real.

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:51.200 line:100%
Thank you.

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:56.520 line:100%
Back then in the hospital,
you told me not to be sappy.

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:58.640 line:100%
Look who's being sappy now.

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:01.440 line:100%
Right.

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:09.040 line:100%
Oh, sir.

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:11.800 line:100%
Did you find anything useful on your trip?

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:17.400 line:100%
I told you not to drink,
but you wouldn't listen.

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:19.480 line:100%
Have some water.

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:25.680 line:100%
Sir,

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:29.560 line:100%
I'll request the higher-ups
to give you a longer break.

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:36.880 line:100%
HE YUANHANG, SECOND-CLASS MERIT

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:41.480 line:100%
I can't take my wage
without working for it.

00:20:43.120 --> 00:20:44.560 line:100%
I want to give it one last shot

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:47.040 line:100%
and investigate Yuanlongli again.

00:20:49.320 --> 00:20:50.800 line:100%
Even if I find nothing in the end,

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:55.360 line:100%
at the very least, I can close
the chapter once and for all.

00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:12.000 line:100%
MISSING PERSON TURNED INTO KIDNAP

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:13.560 line:100%
FOUR TEENAGERS STILL MISSING

00:21:15.280 --> 00:21:16.600 line:100%
ARE THE POLICE USELESS?

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:17.960 line:100%
ARE THEY DEAD OR ALIVE?

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:26.480 line:100%
How many days till the deadline?

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:37.720 line:100%
Captain Qu. Permission
to assign several policemen

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:39.240 line:100%
to assist me.

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:41.320 line:100%
I want to give it my last shot.

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:42.400 line:100%
Captain Qu.

00:21:42.920 --> 00:21:45.040 line:100%
I'd like to work with Xiaohe.

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:48.120 line:100%
I want to work with Xiaohe too.

00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:53.920 line:100%
He is the support I found for us.

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:56.360 line:100%
Old He, help us show them
what we're capable of.

00:21:58.320 --> 00:22:00.240 line:100%
Old He?

00:22:00.320 --> 00:22:02.240 line:100%
Who are you calling old here?

00:22:02.320 --> 00:22:03.560 line:100%
Sorry.

00:22:03.640 --> 00:22:06.840 line:100%
Perhaps we should just call you Mr. He.

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:08.320 line:100%
-Say it.
-Mr. He.

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:10.000 line:100%
That's nice.

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:11.320 line:100%
Mr. He,

00:22:11.400 --> 00:22:12.720 line:100%
how will we investigate Yuanlongli?

00:22:12.800 --> 00:22:15.920 line:100%
Mei is involved in many abduction cases.

00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:18.280 line:100%
He is cunning and good at disguising.

00:22:18.360 --> 00:22:21.880 line:100%
We cannot predict what he will do
by using a logical mind.

00:22:22.480 --> 00:22:23.760 line:100%
For a serial abductor,

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:27.760 line:100%
the most dangerous place
is the safest place.

00:22:27.840 --> 00:22:30.320 line:100%
That's how they hide under our noses.

00:22:30.400 --> 00:22:32.720 line:100%
Dad. Just cut to the chase.

00:22:32.800 --> 00:22:35.920 line:100%
Yuanlongli will be redeveloped soon.

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:37.840 line:100%
Many residents have moved away.

00:22:37.920 --> 00:22:39.960 line:100%
All those empty units

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:43.880 line:100%
are the perfect hiding spot for Mei.

00:22:44.600 --> 00:22:46.800 line:100%
Dad, how come you are so sure

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:48.520 line:100%
that Mei will be hiding under our noses?

00:22:48.600 --> 00:22:49.480 line:100%
I'm not sure.

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:54.360 line:100%
But I have a feeling
that there's something more

00:22:55.360 --> 00:22:57.000 line:100%
hiding in Yuanlongli.

00:23:20.880 --> 00:23:23.520 line:100%
Officer He, you came to work again.

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:28.720 line:100%
Ma Qiang. Fire safety
is very important during winter.

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:29.960 line:100%
-All of you…
-Officer He.

00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:31.240 line:100%
Officer He, you're here again.

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:35.600 line:100%
Honestly though, he has worked
as a policeman for so long.

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:37.880 line:100%
He finally cracked a big case

00:23:37.960 --> 00:23:39.120 line:100%
and got a Second-Class Merit.

00:23:39.200 --> 00:23:40.800 line:100%
Also, it was Officer Ran
who let him claim the credit.

00:23:41.480 --> 00:23:44.000 line:100%
I also heard that his health is bad.

00:23:44.080 --> 00:23:45.600 line:100%
He is claiming disability aid now.

00:23:46.920 --> 00:23:49.200 line:100%
Wasn't the case closed already?

00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:51.040 line:100%
Why is he still in Yuanlongli?

00:23:52.280 --> 00:23:53.680 line:100%
He can't move on.

00:23:53.760 --> 00:23:55.880 line:100%
He needs to feel useful.

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:12.680 line:100%
Go. Carry it. Quick.

00:24:13.800 --> 00:24:15.560 line:100%
You two. It's good enough.

00:24:15.640 --> 00:24:16.960 line:100%
Good enough. Hurry up now.

00:24:17.960 --> 00:24:19.200 line:100%
Hurry up.

00:25:19.800 --> 00:25:21.000 line:100%
Oh my!

00:25:22.120 --> 00:25:23.240 line:100%
Officer He.

00:25:24.320 --> 00:25:25.360 line:100%
What are you doing here?

00:25:29.040 --> 00:25:31.080 line:100%
I'm here to look for leads.

00:25:31.160 --> 00:25:34.040 line:100%
Give me the keys to the management office
of New York Block.

00:25:36.640 --> 00:25:38.640 line:100%
The keys…

00:25:41.160 --> 00:25:43.040 line:100%
Follow me to the office.

00:25:44.120 --> 00:25:45.440 line:100%
Come.

00:25:52.800 --> 00:25:53.760 line:100%
Officer He.

00:25:54.800 --> 00:25:56.080 line:100%
The keys?

00:25:56.920 --> 00:25:57.920 line:100%
What did you do?

00:26:00.080 --> 00:26:03.480 line:100%
I… We are building a cement block.

00:26:08.440 --> 00:26:09.520 line:100%
Seriously?

00:26:10.120 --> 00:26:11.400 line:100%
A cement block here?

00:26:11.480 --> 00:26:13.360 line:100%
Many people walk here. It's inconvenient.

00:26:13.440 --> 00:26:15.120 line:100%
I'm trying to be considerate.

00:26:15.200 --> 00:26:17.960 line:100%
The workers push
their wheelbarrows around.

00:26:18.040 --> 00:26:19.840 line:100%
A barricade here

00:26:19.920 --> 00:26:22.840 line:100%
can remind them not to hit anyone.

00:26:30.760 --> 00:26:32.040 line:100%
The keys.

00:26:34.960 --> 00:26:36.080 line:100%
Let's go.

00:26:36.160 --> 00:26:41.680 line:100%
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY
BUREAU NANSHAN BRANCH

00:26:47.160 --> 00:26:48.280 line:100%
POLICE BY THE PEOPLE
FOR THE PEOPLE

00:26:48.360 --> 00:26:49.280 line:100%
I was looking for you, Fangxu.

00:26:49.360 --> 00:26:51.200 line:100%
Mei's accomplices confessed everything.

00:26:51.280 --> 00:26:52.640 line:100%
But they do not know where his base is.

00:26:52.720 --> 00:26:53.960 line:100%
Their communication
has always been unilateral.

00:26:56.640 --> 00:26:58.280 line:100%
Grab a screenshot
from the internet cafe's footage.

00:26:58.360 --> 00:26:59.720 line:100%
Then, update Mei's photo

00:26:59.800 --> 00:27:00.720 line:100%
-in our internal system.
-Okay.

00:27:02.600 --> 00:27:04.360 line:100%
Madam. Madam. Madam.

00:27:04.960 --> 00:27:06.000 line:100%
I'm looking for the criminal police.

00:27:06.080 --> 00:27:06.920 line:100%
What's the matter?

00:27:07.000 --> 00:27:07.960 line:100%
I want to report a case.

00:27:08.040 --> 00:27:10.000 line:100%
Come. Let's get you registered first.

00:27:10.080 --> 00:27:11.840 line:100%
It's urgent. I need to report a case.

00:27:11.920 --> 00:27:13.040 line:100%
Wu.

00:27:13.760 --> 00:27:15.280 line:100%
-Captain Ran.
-Madam.

00:27:15.360 --> 00:27:16.680 line:100%
Why are you looking
for the criminal police?

00:27:16.760 --> 00:27:18.080 line:100%
I want to report a case.

00:27:18.160 --> 00:27:19.160 line:100%
A murder in Yuanlongli.

00:27:32.480 --> 00:27:33.960 line:100%
This place is foul.

00:27:34.040 --> 00:27:36.120 line:100%
I rented this place for three years,

00:27:36.200 --> 00:27:38.440 line:100%
and I had to pay for so many things.

00:27:38.520 --> 00:27:39.520 line:100%
Buddy,

00:27:39.600 --> 00:27:40.680 line:100%
are you looking for a place to stay?

00:27:40.760 --> 00:27:42.200 line:100%
Run away now.

00:27:42.280 --> 00:27:43.840 line:100%
This place only has bad luck.

00:27:43.920 --> 00:27:45.000 line:100%
It's haunted.

00:27:45.080 --> 00:27:46.600 line:100%
Just run. Save yourself.

00:27:46.680 --> 00:27:48.360 line:100%
Whoever stays here is cursed.

00:27:58.640 --> 00:28:01.240 line:100%
HUAINAN TEMPLE

00:28:17.720 --> 00:28:19.280 line:100%
Mister,

00:28:19.360 --> 00:28:21.320 line:100%
you seem troubled.

00:28:21.400 --> 00:28:23.480 line:100%
Allow me to draw you

00:28:23.560 --> 00:28:25.400 line:100%
an evil-cleansing talisman.

00:28:25.480 --> 00:28:26.640 line:100%
Come.

00:28:27.640 --> 00:28:28.840 line:100%
Come.

00:28:31.440 --> 00:28:33.240 line:100%
Don't be so rough. Please.

00:28:33.320 --> 00:28:35.120 line:100%
-Don't be so rough.
-Spread superstitions again

00:28:35.200 --> 00:28:37.160 line:100%
-and I will arrest you.
-Don't be so rough.

00:28:37.240 --> 00:28:39.240 line:100%
Don't be so rough.

00:28:39.320 --> 00:28:40.480 line:100%
RAN

00:28:40.560 --> 00:28:41.800 line:100%
-Don't be so rough.
-Shut up.

00:28:43.640 --> 00:28:45.280 line:100%
-Sir.
-It hurts.

00:28:45.360 --> 00:28:46.200 line:100%
<i>Where are you?</i>

00:28:46.280 --> 00:28:47.640 line:100%
Where else can I be?

00:28:47.720 --> 00:28:49.080 line:100%
<i>Come back to the station.</i>

00:28:49.600 --> 00:28:51.000 line:100%
Let me investigate the floor first.

00:28:51.080 --> 00:28:52.520 line:100%
<i>No need.</i>

00:28:52.600 --> 00:28:55.320 line:100%
<i>We may no longer need to visit Yuanlongli.</i>

00:29:01.200 --> 00:29:02.120 line:100%
<i>I'm not scared.</i>

00:29:02.720 --> 00:29:03.800 line:100%
<i>I have money.</i>

00:29:03.880 --> 00:29:05.640 line:100%
<i>I can kill many people,</i>
<i>and others will take the blame for me.</i>

00:29:05.720 --> 00:29:06.560 line:100%
<i>You can't do anything.</i>

00:29:06.640 --> 00:29:08.640 line:100%
<i>You can't do anything to me!</i>

00:29:09.360 --> 00:29:11.720 line:100%
<i>You have two options.</i>

00:29:11.800 --> 00:29:13.600 line:100%
<i>One, I'll burn the photos,</i>

00:29:13.680 --> 00:29:15.440 line:100%
<i>and you'll go somewhere to lay low.</i>

00:29:15.520 --> 00:29:16.400 line:100%
<i>Two,</i>

00:29:16.480 --> 00:29:19.120 line:100%
<i>I'll send the photos and the recording</i>
<i>to the police.</i>

00:29:19.640 --> 00:29:22.160 line:100%
<i>Do you want your freedom and money?</i>

00:29:22.240 --> 00:29:23.320 line:100%
<i>It's your choice.</i>

00:29:27.280 --> 00:29:30.560 line:100%
Director Li of Dongshan Mine
killed himself inside the police station

00:29:30.640 --> 00:29:31.680 line:100%
five years ago.

00:29:31.760 --> 00:29:33.560 line:100%
Today, his surviving wife
came to report a case.

00:29:33.640 --> 00:29:36.760 line:100%
She claimed to have found
Director Li's hidden photos

00:29:36.840 --> 00:29:38.800 line:100%
and recordings when she was moving out.

00:29:39.400 --> 00:29:43.440 line:100%
This suggests Director Li
coerced Song Qingsong into leaving.

00:29:43.520 --> 00:29:46.320 line:100%
But how did Director Li get these photos?

00:29:46.920 --> 00:29:49.880 line:100%
Only two people had the opportunity
to give Director Li the photos.

00:29:50.720 --> 00:29:52.360 line:100%
Cripple Du. Wu Shanlong.

00:29:52.440 --> 00:29:54.360 line:100%
I'm inclined to believe
it was Wu Shanlong.

00:29:54.440 --> 00:29:55.720 line:100%
After all, he stood to profit the most

00:29:55.800 --> 00:29:57.760 line:100%
after Song Qingsong left.

00:29:57.840 --> 00:30:00.040 line:100%
We also found a photocopy
of the tender document

00:30:00.120 --> 00:30:02.560 line:100%
inside Wu Shanlong's home.

00:30:02.640 --> 00:30:04.680 line:100%
While he refused to admit
that he kept the document,

00:30:05.200 --> 00:30:07.120 line:100%
it doesn't mean
that he didn't use the photocopy

00:30:07.200 --> 00:30:09.000 line:100%
to blackmail Song Qingsong.

00:30:10.040 --> 00:30:10.880 line:100%
I even suspect

00:30:10.960 --> 00:30:13.760 line:100%
that the blackmailing letter
written to Song Qingsong by Xu Meng

00:30:13.840 --> 00:30:14.960 line:100%
was forged by him.

00:30:17.520 --> 00:30:20.120 line:100%
Song Qingsong never would have thought

00:30:20.200 --> 00:30:22.880 line:100%
that his brother-in-law was the one
who sabotaged him.

00:30:27.400 --> 00:30:30.760 line:100%
Unfortunately, she failed to escape.

00:30:39.960 --> 00:30:42.560 line:100%
The main culprit, Wu Shanlong, is dead.

00:30:43.160 --> 00:30:44.880 line:100%
The one who hired a hitman, Song Qingsong,

00:30:44.960 --> 00:30:46.920 line:100%
fled abroad for many years.

00:30:48.520 --> 00:30:51.760 line:100%
All we can do now
is to release a wanted poster.

00:30:54.000 --> 00:30:55.440 line:100%
But I don't understand one thing.

00:30:56.760 --> 00:30:59.520 line:100%
Wu Shanlong isn't smart.

00:31:01.200 --> 00:31:03.560 line:100%
How could he devise so many plans?

00:31:19.200 --> 00:31:21.000 line:100%
Ms. Zhao, you're out.

00:31:21.080 --> 00:31:23.120 line:100%
Ms. Zhao, you look so beautiful.

00:31:23.200 --> 00:31:25.400 line:100%
After our new treatment,

00:31:25.480 --> 00:31:26.880 line:100%
you look younger and prettier.

00:31:28.120 --> 00:31:30.560 line:100%
I have solid genes. My heels.

00:31:30.640 --> 00:31:32.840 line:100%
XINXIN BEAUTY SALON

00:31:32.920 --> 00:31:35.120 line:100%
Young girls like you

00:31:35.200 --> 00:31:37.320 line:100%
shouldn't just chase
after physical beauty blindly.

00:31:37.400 --> 00:31:40.120 line:100%
A woman's real charisma
doesn't come from her face,

00:31:40.760 --> 00:31:41.880 line:100%
but here.

00:31:44.400 --> 00:31:48.000 line:100%
Ms. Zhao. The balance
on your membership card is running low.

00:31:48.080 --> 00:31:49.640 line:100%
Do you want to…

00:31:52.320 --> 00:31:53.120 line:100%
Top up another 10,000 yuan.

00:31:53.200 --> 00:31:56.800 line:100%
How generous of you, Ms. Zhao.

00:31:57.320 --> 00:31:58.720 line:100%
Men are unreliable.

00:31:59.400 --> 00:32:01.080 line:100%
As women, we should treat ourselves.

00:32:01.160 --> 00:32:02.000 line:100%
See you.

00:32:02.800 --> 00:32:04.400 line:100%
Bye, Ms. Zhao.

00:32:04.480 --> 00:32:05.600 line:100%
Come back again.

00:32:05.680 --> 00:32:07.040 line:100%
Drive safely.

00:32:08.760 --> 00:32:09.920 line:100%
I'm so sick of her.

00:32:10.000 --> 00:32:11.080 line:100%
Listen.

00:32:11.160 --> 00:32:13.640 line:100%
She used to open
a foot massage parlor too.

00:32:13.720 --> 00:32:15.760 line:100%
She found a guy called Wu Shanlong,

00:32:15.840 --> 00:32:18.160 line:100%
and they both took over a cement factory.

00:32:18.240 --> 00:32:20.200 line:100%
That's how she became rich.

00:32:20.280 --> 00:32:22.240 line:100%
-Is that so?
-Yes.

00:32:23.480 --> 00:32:25.000 line:100%
So, she still relied on a man in the end.

00:33:06.040 --> 00:33:09.080 line:20%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:33:19.400 --> 00:33:22.160 line:100%
Ma Qiang. Give me the list of Yuanlongli's
current residents and tenants.

00:33:22.240 --> 00:33:23.280 line:100%
Several copies of it.

00:33:23.360 --> 00:33:25.840 line:100%
Officer He, what is this for?

00:33:25.920 --> 00:33:27.240 line:100%
Just do what you're told.

00:33:33.040 --> 00:33:34.640 line:100%
How many units have been vacated?

00:33:34.720 --> 00:33:35.920 line:100%
Many.

00:33:36.000 --> 00:33:37.680 line:100%
They are marked in red there.

00:33:38.960 --> 00:33:40.320 line:100%
2015 YUANLONGLI PROPERTY
OWNER/TENANT ROSTER

00:33:40.400 --> 00:33:41.680 line:100%
It seems like we have a busy night ahead.

00:33:41.760 --> 00:33:43.160 line:100%
Let's split up.

00:33:43.240 --> 00:33:46.000 line:100%
Zheng Zhong, you, Bai, and Hui
are in charge of Floors 1 to 9.

00:33:46.080 --> 00:33:47.480 line:100%
Xiaohe and I will check the ones upstairs.

00:33:47.560 --> 00:33:49.400 line:100%
Use the walkie-talkie
if you find anything.

00:33:49.480 --> 00:33:50.480 line:100%
Understood.

00:34:03.240 --> 00:34:06.440 line:20%
DEMOLITION

00:34:20.120 --> 00:34:21.920 line:100%
The vacant units on the eastern side
of the 4th floor

00:34:22.000 --> 00:34:23.040 line:100%
are 13 and 16.

00:34:23.719 --> 00:34:24.560 line:100%
Let's check 13 first.

00:35:56.640 --> 00:35:58.440 line:100%
It hurts! Be gentle. It hurts!

00:35:58.520 --> 00:35:59.840 line:100%
Shut up!

00:36:12.880 --> 00:36:14.440 line:100%
An escape room?

00:36:14.960 --> 00:36:17.880 line:100%
Do you even have the license for it?

